  "reviewMethod": "Visually inspected all four contact sheets, covering every one of20 actual optimized screenshots, plus the full600dp/font1.6 strip.",
  "findings": [
    "All six dialog layouts show complete title, current file, paused byte count and reachable Resume, Cancel, Details, Open folder and Close controls.",
    "All six compact-strip layouts retain readable filename and byte count; narrow panes and enlarged text use a separate controls row.",
    "The600dp/font1.6 strip now shows the full synthetic filename and the byte count rather than the rejected10dp text column.",
    "Provider wait contains no invented rate or ETA; recovery shows recent throughput and a phase-specific estimate; pause hides both.",
    "Unknown-size copying shows processed bytes and recent speed without a guessed total or remaining time.",
    "The real system picker selects the read-only synthetic root; cancellation and completed history are visible.",
    "Only synthetic filenames and the seeded setup appear in these public screenshots."
